   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2016-09-14",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "Labor supports the Corporations Amendment (Auditor Registration) Bill 2016, arguing it was previously trampled by the Prime Minister’s rush to an election, and questioned when a joint sitting would follow the double dissolution."
